author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 11:44:10 -0600
subject: feat(smart-router): add pre-combo interception smart router with dynamic combo fallback

- Create src/sse/services/smartRouter.js: app-layer task classifier, model scorer,
  dynamic combo creation, concurrency tracking, session stickiness (5-min TTL)
- Modify src/sse/handlers/chat.js: add resolveSmartRouter() pre-combo interception
  after detectRequiredCapabilities(), before getComboModels()
- Modify src/lib/db/repos/settingsRepo.js: add smartRouter defaults (enabled, names,
  allowedProviders, costQualityTradeoff, maxCandidates)
- Modify open-sse/handlers/chatCore.js: pass originalBody to executor for re-dispatch

Architecture: pre-combo interception avoids double-translation flaw of executor approach.
Smart router classifies task, scores models, creates dynamic combo, existing combo
fallback engine handles retries automatically.

Part of: Smart Router and Fallback UX Enhancement plan (Phase 1)


